@startuml
left to right direction
actor "Secretária" as S
actor "Médico" as M
rectangle "Gestão de consultas Vida+" {
 usecase "Cadastrar paciente" as C
 usecase "Agendar consulta" as A
 usecase "Confirmar consulta" as F
 usecase "Cancelar consulta" as X
 usecase "Verificar cadastro" as V
 usecase "Gerar receita" as R
 usecase "Imprimir receita" as I
}
S -- C
S -- A
S -- F
S -- X
M -- X
M -- R
A ..> V : <<include>>
F ..> V : <<include>>
R ..> I : <<include>>
note bottom of V
 Pré-condição para agendar ou confirmar:
 paciente previamente cadastrado.
end note
@enduml

